SUMMARY:Serbia: New-hire contribution refund extended to 2028\; new conditi
 ons from 2028 (unofficial Ministry text)
DESCRIPTION:Upcoming\, 1 Jan 2027. The Law amending the Law on Mandatory So
 cial Insurance Contributions (Official Gazette 80/2026\, in force from 8 S
 eptember 2026) extends the refund of contributions for new hires in Articl
 e 45 to wages paid up to 31 December 2028\, from 1 January 2027\, accordin
 g to the Ministry of Finance's unofficial consolidated text. The refund co
 vers part of the contributions paid (employee and employer share) on the w
 age of a newly hired person. The same text applies the new conditions in A
 rticle 1 paragraphs 2 to 12 only from 1 January 2028.\n\nSource: https://w
 ww.mfin.gov.rs/upload/media/c59gCf_6aa14bd2e2c04.docx\nDetails: https://ww
 w.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/serbia.html#rs-new-hire-refund-2028\n\nF
 or information only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 Octo
 ber 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/serbia.html#rs-new-hire-ref
 und-2028
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
